            {
                "id": null,
                "preferredName": "J. Thoms",
                "firstName": "J.",
                "lastName": "Thoms"
            }
        ],
        "abstract": "As humans few of us are aware of the complexity of our own orientation process, but to develop a truly autonomous system we need to recognise these needs and to find ways by which they can be achieved by a system. This presentation begins to provide an understanding of the complexities of this problem and a possible representation of OODA for an autonomous system.",
