        "abstract": "Effective multinational capability delivery in networked enabled capability is impacted by legacy systems, multinational operation command and control, the establishment of common understanding, and effective decision-making. Using a combat search and rescue (CSAR) vignette as a backdrop, this paper discusses these challenges in terms of the advances in autonomous technologies, associated architectural approaches and support for decision-making processes.",
